    "title": "Faith or politics? Billings church to host Make Heaven Crowded event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago A gospel-centered event called the Make Heaven Crowded Tour, organized by Turning Point USA, is coming to Emmanuel Baptist Church in Billings on June 26th, and it's sparking conversation in the community. Some Billings residents, including church member Sam Yarbro, have raised concerns about political messaging being mixed with faith, while Lead Pastor Paul Jones says the event is focused solely on Jesus and will feature pastors, evangelists, and Christian music artists. Both sides agree that people should have all the information before attending. Read full article\n3",
